@base = http://localhost:3000

### List restaurants
GET {{base}}/restaurants

### Restaurant menu
GET {{base}}/restaurants/1/menu

### Immediate order
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"restaurant_id":1,"items":[{"id":1,"quantity":2}],"delivery_address":"123 Main St"}

### Scheduled order (replace with a time 45 min–7 days ahead, while restaurant is open)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"restaurant_id":1,"items":[{"id":1,"quantity":1}],"delivery_address":"123 Main St","scheduled_delivery_time":"2026-11-01T18:00:00-05:00"}

### Get order
GET {{base}}/orders/1

### Update placed order status
PATCH {{base}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"PREPARING"}

### Cancel scheduled order before release (replace ID)
POST {{base}}/orders/1/cancel

### Create Scheduled Order
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurant_id": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "menu_item_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "delivery_address": "123 Main Street, Bronx, NY",
  "scheduled_delivery_time": "2026-10-31T18:00:00-04:00"
}

### Cancel Scheduled Order
POST http://localhost:3000/orders/2/cancel
Content-Type: application/


### Check Order Status
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/2